                                             QUERY PLAN                                              
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Finalize Aggregate  (cost=11738.02..11738.03 rows=1 width=8)
   ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)  (cost=11737.96..11738.01 rows=3 width=8)
         ->  Partial Aggregate  (cost=11737.96..11737.97 rows=1 width=8)
               ->  Bitmap Heap Scan on bmscantest2  (cost=53.82..11734.83 rows=1253 width=0)
                     Recheck Cond: ((a = 1) OR (b = 1) OR (c = 1))
                     ->  BitmapOr  (cost=53.82..53.82 rows=1276 width=0)
                           ->  Bitmap Index Scan on i_bmtest2_a  (cost=0.00..17.91 rows=440 width=0)
                                 Index Cond: (a = 1)
                           ->  Bitmap Index Scan on i_bmtest2_b  (cost=0.00..16.90 rows=396 width=0)
                                 Index Cond: (b = 1)
                           ->  Bitmap Index Scan on i_bmtest2_c  (cost=0.00..18.07 rows=440 width=0)
                                 Index Cond: (c = 1)
 Optimizer: Postgres query optimizer
(13 rows)

SELECT count(*) FROM bmscantest2 WHERE a = 1 OR b = 1 OR c = 1;
